  text: "<p><k>Ligatures on \xB7 off</k>\Loffice \xB7 afflict \u2192 <feature=-liga>office \xB7 afflict</feature></p>\n<p><k>Fractions</k>\L<feature=frac>1/2 \xB7 3/4 \xB7 5/8 \xB7 13/16</feature></p>\n<p><k>Old-style figures</k>\L<feature=onum>The 1984 edition sold 2,750,000 copies</feature></p>\n<p><k>Small capitals</k>\L<smallcaps>Typography from the Unicode Consortium</smallcaps></p>\n<p><k>Superscript \xB7 subscript</k>\LE = mc<sup>2</sup> \xB7 H<sub>2</sub>O \xB7 the 1<sup>st</sup> and 2<sup>nd</sup> place</p>\n<k>Slashed zero</k>\L<feature=zero>Order 0O-1020-0080</feature>"
