  text: "<p><b>Patch 1.4</b></p>\n- Inline dropdowns\n  - with any script inside\n  - and right-to-left options\n- Thai lines break between words\n1. Download\n2. Install\n3. Play\n\n<p><k>Tags keep whole while wrapping</k></p>\nUnity<sep>Role-playing<sep>Pixel art<sep>Open world<sep>Co-op<sep>Story rich"
